{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;What do I look like?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On my way home from overtime, a dark figure suddenly appeared before me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faced with the figure's question, and looking at the twintails on her head, longer than my arms, I fell silent...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Cantonese Twintails' Repay of a Favor&quot; is a youth romance galgame, a visual novel. Players can click on the screen to read the dialogue and story text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is single-character, single-ending, and contains no choice branches. The total playtime is approximately 2.5 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features four beautiful, independent animated CGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The female protagonist is fully voiced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This game is a galgame (AVG - text game). It does not contain any other gameplay or systems. Just like reading a novel, you can only click on the screen and read text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note 2: All characters in the game are adults. The characters, stories, locations, plots, and world depicted are all fictional and have no connection to any real-life people or events.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u4f60\u53d1\u73b0\u4e86\u4e00\u53ea\u53cc\u9a6c\u5c3e","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953050/3be632838129812c43f5b3547f832846b15ee5e0.jpg"},{"name":"\u4f60\u771f\u5403\u554a\uff1f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953050/b284082616523ba6a8060df4ede7e6f51364073c.jpg"},{"name":"\u6211\u53bb\uff0c\u4e8c\u523a\u733f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953050/fbb9ae1312cb155e2e62b606726499f05e8a7a55.jpg"},{"name":"\u5fe0\u8bda\uff01","path":"http